  "bodyHash": "9a41cbc2da756f8f",
  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>進入一個寶可夢與 Minecraft 重新交匯的世界</strong></span></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">隆重推出</span>：</strong></h5>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">Pixelmon Beyond the Cobbleverse</span>！</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/740/965/pbc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"168\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">汲取深受喜愛的 Cobblemon: Beyond the Pixelverse 之靈感，我們的全新整合包開啟了一場融合寶可夢與 Minecraft 的嶄新旅程。作為一款曾突破 10,000 次下載並獲得社區熱烈支持的整合包的延續，我們正為一段更加迷人的征航鋪墊舞台。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重塑與強化整合包</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">這趟史詩旅程的核心，正是備受信賴的 Pixelmon 模組，重新點燃寶可夢的經典樂趣。但我們並未止步於此。隨著 <strong><span style=\"color:#008080\">EnderIO</span>、<span style=\"color:#f60\">Railcraft</span> 以及 <span style=\"color:#f00\">Blood Magic</span></strong> 等經典舊愛的回歸，遊戲玩法更加豐富多元，提供多層次的深度與探索體驗。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>踏上全新的冒險與謎題之旅</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">穿梭於純淨原版 Minecraft 的精髓之中，深入 Blood Magic 的神秘深淵、探索 <span style=\"color:#008080\">EnderIO</span> 與 <span style=\"color:#f60\">Railcraft</span> 的精緻系統，以及更多內容。對於追求挑戰的玩家而言，通往終局巔峰的道路正向你招手。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>沉浸氛圍之旅等你展開</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">雖然經典的低保真寶可夢配樂已暫被擱置，但你的旅程依然充滿動人的環境音樂驚喜，在每個轉折處為你獻上精心設計的氛圍體驗，進一步烘托冒險的精髓。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在 Cobbleverse 中鑄就你的傳奇</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">投入一個擁有全新自訂主選單的世界，由我們社區才華洋溢的成員們以熱忱與創意精心打造。每一像素都訴說著玩家們的投入與熱情。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>真摯的感謝信</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">致那些讓 Cobblemon 成為傳說的一萬多名冒險者，以及正準備迎接 Pixelmon Beyond the Cobbleverse 的先驅們，我們的感激之情無以言表。你們的熱情與支持是我們前進的最大動力。</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>翻開嶄新篇章</strong></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">故事仍在延續。今天就下載 Pixelmon Beyond the Cobbleverse，踏上這場寶可夢、Minecraft 與眾多精彩模組共舞的迷人旅程。</span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>模組列表：</strong></span>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rhino\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino (by LatvianModder)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldedit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldEdit (by sk89q)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-grinding-utils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Grinding Utils (by vadis365)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botany-pots-pixelmon-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botany Pots - Pixelmon Compat (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botany-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botany Pots (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spice-of-life-carrot-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spice of Life: Carrot Edition (by lordcazsius)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-optimizer\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Quests Optimizer (by big_energy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/openblocks-elevator\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks Elevator (by vsngarcia)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connected-glass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connected Glass (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory (by botanydev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked (by LainMI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery (by satisfy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-leaf-decay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Leaf Decay (by olafskiii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Villagers (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corn-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corn Delight[Forge] (by sz0999312)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-professions-jep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Professions (JEP) (by Mrbysco)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scalable-cats-force\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scalable Cat's Force (by Kotori316)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farming-for-blockheads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farming for Blockheads (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers (by Texelsaur)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auudio-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Auudio [Forge] (by Keksuccino)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-options\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Options (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/m